<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Hosting Test</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f7f7f5;
      --fg: #1a1a1a;
      --muted: #6b6b6b;
      --card: #ffffff;
      --border: #e3e3df;
      --accent: #c96442;
    }

    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      :root {
        --bg: #17171a;
        --fg: #f0f0ee;
        --muted: #9a9a96;
        --card: #202024;
        --border: #303036;
        --accent: #e08768;
      }
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Apple SD Gothic Neo",
                   "Pretendard", "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--fg);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 24px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 48px 40px;
      max-width: 520px;
      width: 100%;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.04), 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.06);
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--accent);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 5px 12px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .dot {
      width: 7px;
      height: 7px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--accent);
      animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
      50% { opacity: .35; }
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 650;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    p.lead {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    dl {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 12px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    dt { color: var(--muted); flex-shrink: 0; }

    dd {
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
      font-size: 13px;
      text-align: right;
      word-break: break-all;
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 28px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    footer a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
    footer a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .card { padding: 32px 24px; }
      h1 { font-size: 26px; }
      .row { flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }
      dd { text-align: left; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="card">
    <div class="badge"><span class="dot"></span>배포 성공</div>

    <h1>Hosting Test</h1>
    <p class="lead">GitHub Pages에 정적 페이지가 정상적으로 호스팅되고 있습니다.</p>

    <dl>
      <div class="row">
        <dt>저장소</dt>
        <dd>davidyoon891122/HostingTest</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <dt>브랜치</dt>
        <dd>main</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <dt>현재 주소</dt>
        <dd id="host">—</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <dt>접속 시각</dt>
        <dd id="now">—</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>

    <footer>
      정적 파일만으로 동작하는 테스트 페이지입니다 ·
      <a href="https://github.com/davidyoon891122/HostingTest">소스 보기</a>
    </footer>
  </main>

  <script>
    document.getElementById('host').textContent = location.host || 'localhost';
    document.getElementById('now').textContent =
      new Date().toLocaleString('ko-KR', { dateStyle: 'medium', timeStyle: 'medium' });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
